      "title": "dfilter: Fix expressions with bytes as a character constant",
      "message": "dfilter: Fix expressions with bytes as a character constant\n\nBefore:\n  Filter: frame[1] == 'a'\n  dftest: \"'a'\" is not a valid byte string.\n\nAfter:\n  Filter: frame[1] == 'a'\n\n  Constants:\n  00000 PUT_FVALUE\t61 <FT_BYTES> -> reg#2\n\n  Instructions:\n  00000 READ_TREE\t\tframe -> reg#0\n  00001 IF-FALSE-GOTO\t4\n  00002 MK_RANGE\t\treg#0[1:1] -> reg#1\n  00003 ANY_EQ\t\treg#1 == reg#2\n  00004 RETURN\n\nFixes 4d2f4692129b1953c8631d58036bd6ce8cde6d50.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
